OrangeIslands_Mikan_House1_Text_Harbourmaster::
	.string "Harbourmaster, MIKAN. I log every\n"
	.string "hull that ties up here.\p"
	.string "Four gyms in the ORANGE LEAGUE,\n"
	.string "and MIKAN is the one everyone\l"
	.string "reaches first. The badges are not\l"
	.string "in any order. The sea is.$"

OrangeIslands_Mikan_House1_Text_Daughter::
	.string "Dad knows the name of every boat.\n"
	.string "He does not know my friends'.$"

